    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Custom Wooden Crating:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For high‑value or fragile vehicles, build a custom wooden crate that encloses the entire vehicle. The crate should include foam inserts and secure locking mechanisms. This final layer protects against sharp impacts and is especially useful when working with an all India car transport company that operates across diverse terrains.</p>
